  "description": "Trees fronting Chilworth Mews\rT1 Sorbus: Crown lift to 2.5m, pruning only small diameter branches and secondary laterals, concentrating on area overhanging parking space.\rT2 Maple: Crown lift to 4m removing secondary growth only, deadwood.\rT3 Sorbus: Crown lift to 3.5m removing secondary growth only, deadwood, side lateral reduction on east side only by 1.5m to suitable branch junctions. Remove selected branches to clear street light by 0.5m. Tidy stubs.\rT4 Thorn: Prune with hand tools and polesaws branches overhanging parking bays by 0.5m\rT5 Malus: Lift extended laterals to 2.5m back to suitable growth points, deadwood, prune clear of street light giving 0.5m clearance, side lateral reduction on east and west side only by 1m to reduce overhang on parking space."
